{
  "bookId": "hero-213202",
  "id": "bond-29308",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "29308001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "洛瑞丝",
          "text": "这间屋子……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29308002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "洛瑞丝",
          "text": "全心全意服务于您是我的工作，我……怎敢接受这份礼物。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29308003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "只是一些心意。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29308004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "洛瑞丝",
          "text": "啊——是！我会仔细收好的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29308005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "洛瑞丝",
          "text": "已经不知道要怎样才好了，居然如此失礼。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29308006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "洛瑞丝",
          "text": "一直以来，您总是如此辛苦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29308007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "洛瑞丝",
          "text": "凭空得来这些享受，却无法为您分担哪怕一丝忧虑……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29308008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "洛瑞丝",
          "text": "如果可以的话……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29308009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "嗯？洛瑞丝看起来怪怪的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29308010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "洛瑞丝",
          "text": "如果可以，请把您完全的交给我吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29308011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "洛瑞丝",
          "text": "作为您忠实的仆人，我将全方位为您打点每一个细节。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29308012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "洛瑞丝",
          "text": "不论何时，只需呼唤一声，我就会立即抵达您的身边。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29308013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "洛瑞丝",
          "text": "我……对不起，头脑恍惚，说了使您难堪的话。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29308014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "洛瑞丝",
          "text": "此时此刻，我实在情难自己。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29308015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "不会。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29308016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "洛瑞丝",
          "text": "您的意思，是准许这层契约了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29308017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "咳……不出什么差错的话，大概是的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29308018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "洛瑞丝",
          "text": "我会做好这一切——不论任何吩咐，不论任何目的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
